       opaque video - what it buys is the corner and the shadow, which
       is what makes a tile read as an object rather than a crop. */
    .casora-cam-tile {
      box-shadow: var(--casora-popup-plate-shadow, none);
      backdrop-filter: var(--casora-popup-plate-backdrop, none);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--casora-popup-plate-backdrop, none);
      border-radius: var(--casora-popup-row-radius, 20px) !important;
      animation: var(--casora-popup-plate-enter, none);
      animation-delay: var(--casora-popup-plate-delay, 0ms);
    }
